# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this reproduction, cite the original FedBrain paper and this repository."
title: "FedBrain reproduction: six-site federated brain-network learning with a recorded data-flow explorer"
abstract: >-
  A runnable reproduction of the FedBrain federated learning framework on public ABIDE-I
  data, with a browser interface that shows which health data stay at each site and which
  tensors cross the federation boundary. Paper-reported accuracy is not reproduced.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Cybermatics-prog/fedbrain-federated-brain-network"
keywords:
  - federated learning
  - brain connectivity
  - ABIDE
  - autism
  - reproduction
references:
  - type: article
    title: >-
      FedBrain: A robust multi-site brain network analysis framework based on federated
      learning for brain disease diagnosis
    authors:
      - family-names: Zhang
        given-names: Chang
    journal: Neurocomputing
    volume: 559
    start: 126791
    year: 2023
    doi: 10.1016/j.neucom.2023.126791
